    Now the quasiproduct $M=A\boxtimes T=\sum_{z}t_zB_z$ and by \eqref{qpord} we have $MM^*=\sum_{z,w}t_z\overline{t_w}\lambda \Delta_{zw^{-1}}$. This matrix is scalar if and only if $TT^*$ is scalar, which proves the theorem.

